prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/
class RegulatedUseGrant
class RegulatedUse
class Permit
class Extension
class Application
class PublicHearing
class DecisionMakingBody
property grant_for domain RegulatedUseGrant range RegulatedUse min 1 max 1
property permit_under domain Permit range RegulatedUseGrant
property extension_of domain Extension range RegulatedUseGrant min 1 max 1
property authorized_by domain Extension range DecisionMakingBody min 1 max 1
property new_application_for domain Application range RegulatedUse
property hearing_for domain PublicHearing range Application
datatype granted_at domain RegulatedUseGrant range LocalDate min 1 max 1
datatype obtained_at domain Permit range LocalDate min 1 max 1
datatype extended_until domain Extension range LocalDate min 1 max 1
predicate unlawfully_established_or_expanded domain RegulatedUse
predicate legalized_by_regulated_use_hearing domain RegulatedUse
